21-# Cold-Start Interview: Employment Counsel
22-
23-## Purpose
24-
25-Employment law is jurisdictional down to the bone. The right answer in one jurisdiction is the wrong answer in the next. This interview maps your footprint — every country and sub-jurisdiction with employees — resolves the primary jurisdiction code against `references/jurisdictions/REGISTRY.md`, offers that jurisdiction's playbook defaults, and builds an escalation table that knows which rules apply where.
