205-#### Write to the config CLAUDE.md
206-
207-Write `## Who's using this`, `## Available integrations`, and `## Outputs` sections immediately after the first section of the config-path CLAUDE.md (the plugin config) per the template in `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/CLAUDE.md`. These drive work-product header choice and feature-fallback behavior across every skill in this plugin.
