349-| Answer (interview step) | Profile field |
350-|---|---|
351-| Primary code (Part 1) | `## Jurisdiction` → Primary jurisdiction |
352-| Other countries, with populated status (Part 1) | `## Jurisdiction` → Footprint; `## Jurisdictional footprint` → Other countries with employees |
353-| `MANIFEST.md` → `authoritative_language` | `## Jurisdiction` → Authoritative language of the primary jurisdiction |
